Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.50,0:02:54.59,BGS1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\bord2}【『第 3 新东京市街战』中间报告书】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.50,0:02:54.59,Default2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【负责人 作战部长 葛城美里上尉】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.71,0:02:56.42,Default2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【关于第三使徒以及初号机】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.55,0:03:00.47,Default2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【确认发现 A.T.Felid 存在】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.51,0:03:07.22,Default2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【初号机、目标 A.T.Felid 被侵食】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.75,0:02:55.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就结果而言，也许我们遭受了极大的损失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.02,0:02:58.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是毫无经验的少年在初战中迎击未知目标
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.52,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}最终取得胜利
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.99,0:03:03.95,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我认为应该对碇真嗣的功绩加以赞赏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.42,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是，对作战部来说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.65,0:03:11.66,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}则是突显出更多的问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.91,0:03:14.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}使人深刻反省的苦战
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【使徒、被歼灭】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:20.82,0:03:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【防御设施部分损坏　EVA 初号机中度破损】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.91,0:03:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【没有公开这起事件中的人员伤亡情况】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.33,0:03:49.89,BGS1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}【节选自铃原冬二的作文中】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.39,0:03:34.85,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我的妹妹刚上小学二年级
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.44,0:03:37.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在前几天的骚乱中受了伤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.56,0:03:39.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不是因为敌人而是因为自己人失控才受的伤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.68,0:03:43.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我实在无法原谅这种蠢事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我想让制造机器人的大人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.25,0:03:49.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也尝尝我妹妹的痛苦和我的愤怒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.52,0:03:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【第四使徒】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【伊甸天使，来袭】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.86,0:04:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【当时，地对空防御系统运转率为 48.2%】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.66,0:04:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【第 3 新东京市，96.8% 已转换成战斗状态】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.75,0:04:23.84,BGS1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}【节选自洞木光的笔记】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.80,0:04:15.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为以前经常和朋友在学校里做避难训练
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.75,0:04:17.83,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在一点真实感也没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.67,0:04:20.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}男生们好象是去郊游一样的喧闹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.35,0:04:23.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们也一点不觉得害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.39,0:04:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【使徒、到达第 3 新东京市上空】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.27,0:04:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【第二次正面交战】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.45,0:04:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【在外部电源断线的不利情况下】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.55,0:05:03.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【使徒、被歼灭】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.76,0:05:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【NERV 得到了保持原样的使徒标本】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.68,0:05:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【但是，分析结果的最终报告一直没有提交】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.56,0:05:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【第五使徒】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:23.61,0:05:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【雷天使、来袭】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.15,0:05:26.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【对这个久攻不下的目标】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:26.86,0:05:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【葛城上尉提出了屋岛作战计划，获得批准】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.49,0:05:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【第一适格者】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.20,0:05:35.20,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}【EVA 零号机专属驾驶员】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.08,0:05:40.00,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}【绫波丽】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.04,0:05:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【驾驶刚解除禁用的零号机，首次出击】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.26,0:05:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【同日深夜，使徒的一部分侵入地下都市】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.85,0:05:55.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【NERV 果断执行屋岛作战计划】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.52,0:06:13.41,BGS1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}【节选自相田健介的个人资料】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.71,0:05:57.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}虽然碇什么也不说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.05,0:06:00.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但我认为在目标的加速粒子泡下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.32,0:06:03.31,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是零号机舍身保护了初号机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不，我确信如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.11,0:06:08.27,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}理由只有一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.18,0:06:09.82,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就是绫波丽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.22,0:06:14.92,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为绫波看起来对自己的存在感很稀薄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.95,0:06:20.76,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她好象是有点悲观主义
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.57,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}很难想象她和我们一样都是 14 岁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.50,Default2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【屋岛作战成功】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.79,0:06:18.50,Default2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【零号机严重破损】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.88,0:06:22.29,Default2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【幸好，驾驶员平安无事】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【第六使徒】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.43,0:06:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【和 鱼天使 遭遇】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.92,0:06:34.67,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这次时间与剧本稍微有些出入
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.17,0:06:37.87,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，结果在预测范围内
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.28,0:06:39.43,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可以接受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.77,0:06:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【第二适格者】
