Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:44.86,0:06:48.32,Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}【{\fs67.5\fnEVA-FANS方正粗宋}惣{\r}流·明日香·兰利】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.36,0:06:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【驾驶 EVA 二号机首次出击】
