Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【以及】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.38,0:07:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【初次在水中作战】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.73,0:07:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【在旧伊东外海的遭遇战中】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.36,0:07:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【使徒、被歼灭】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.06,0:07:33.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在这次遭遇战中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.70,0:07:37.48,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}国联海军损失了舰艇总数的 1/3
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.81,0:07:40.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}损失的是你们国家的船吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.55,0:07:42.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这根本是不值一提的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.46,0:07:46.88,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没错，这种程度的损失没什么，已经很幸运了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【第七使徒】
